{"title": "Sussur Bloom", "pageid": 7904, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sussur_Bloom", "categories": ["Bugs", "Misc items", "Story items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-story\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png/300px-Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sussur Bloom image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png/300px-Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Sussur_Bloom_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/38px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/50px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sussur Bloom Item Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png/25px-Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Sussur_Bloom_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Sussur Bloom</span></a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Story_Item\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Story Item\">Story Item</a> which creates an <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_(Condition)\" title=\"Sussur Flower Antimagic Field (Condition)\">antimagic field</a> around itself. The bloom wilts and is ruined if brought out of the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>This bright blue flower, picked from a budding sussur tree, exudes a honey-sweet aroma, which turns foul and eventually fades away if the bloom is exposed to sunlight.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Story Item\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #FF5901 ;\">Story Item</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0 kg (0 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0 kg (0 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-fd3072e47408a9abEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-43b9fcb4b8edbbb1END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-3a9413b2ee602c31END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_UND_SussurTreeFlower</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_SussurTreeFlower\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_SussurTreeFlower\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">8706eab3-e05b-478d-833e-308379972dad</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8706eab3-e05b-478d-833e-308379972dad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:8706eab3-e05b-478d-833e-308379972dad\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_SussurTree_Flower</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_SussurTree_Flower+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_SussurTree_Flower+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Sussur_Antimagic_Field\"> Condition: Sussur Antimagic Field </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Antimagic_Field_(Condition)\" title=\"Sussur Antimagic Field (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sussur Antimagic Field\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Sussur_Flower_Antimagic_Field_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sussur_Antimagic_Field_(Condition)\" title=\"Sussur Antimagic Field (Condition)\">Sussur Antimagic Field</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Sussur blooms nullify nearby magic.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>4x - on and around the large Sussur Tree in the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark#Dread_Hollow\" title=\"Underdark\">Dread Hollow</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-14&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-138</span>.</li>\n<li>2x - at the Garden just outside the door of the ground floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Tower\" title=\"Arcane Tower\">Arcane Tower</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The antimagic field affects nearby creatures as well as the character holding the item. It prevents the use of spells, but not of magical actions which are not spells, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charges</a>.</li>\n<li>Sussur Blooms can be used to disable <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Animated_Armour\" title=\"Animated Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Animated_Armour.png/25px-Portrait_Animated_Armour.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Animated_Armour.png/38px-Portrait_Animated_Armour.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Animated_Armour.png/50px-Portrait_Animated_Armour.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Animated Armours\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a6/Portrait_Animated_Armour.png/25px-Portrait_Animated_Armour.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a6/Portrait_Animated_Armour.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Animated_Armour\" title=\"Animated Armour\">Animated Armours</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Turret\" title=\"Arcane Turret\">Arcane Turrets</a>. Doing so grants the inspiration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Secrets_of_the_Sussur_Tree\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Secrets of the Sussur Tree\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Secrets_of_the_Sussur_Tree\" title=\"Sage\">Secrets of the Sussur Tree</a> to party members with the <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorcerers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Class_Sorcerer_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> have a special interaction the first time they are within the range of a Sussur Bloom, as being without their innate magic is unusual and unsettling to them. A companion may notice that the Sorcerer feels uncomfortable and chat briefly with them; companions react differently depending on their approval. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Bloodline\" title=\"Draconic Bloodline\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Draconic Sorcerers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/Class_Sorcerer_Draconic_Bloodline_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Bloodline\" title=\"Draconic Bloodline\">Draconic Sorcerers</a> can specifically call out to their ancestor for help, but nothing happens.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Blooms wither outside the underdark with two exceptions. Both preserve the anti-magic aura:\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Traveller%27s_Chest\" title=\"Traveller's Chest\">Traveller's Chest</a> in camp</li>\n<li>Any locked container – It is possible to put items into a locked container without unlocking it by drag and drop.</li></ul></li>\n<li>As the antimagic effect is applied via scripting, using cheats to spawn this item via its UUID results in a non-functional version of the item.</li>\n<li>As of Patch 7, Sussur Blooms can be \"smuggled\" into the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a> by selling them to either <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baelen_Bonecloak\" title=\"Baelen Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baelen Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Baelen_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Baelen_Bonecloak\" title=\"Baelen Bonecloak\">Baelen Bonecloak</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>. They are fully functional, and Derryth or Baelen emit a Sussur Anti-Magic Field whilst holding the blooms in their inventory. The blooms can be bought back or pickpocketed.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"Fixed in Patch 8?\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The antimagic field does not prevent characters from applying the cantrip <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guidance_(Condition)\" title=\"Guidance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Guidance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Guidance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guidance_(Condition)\" title=\"Guidance (Condition)\">Guidance</a> during dice rolls.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715003329\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3957/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 53565/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17226/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1307489/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   73.724      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   73.724      1 -total\n 42.11%   31.044     13 Template:Icon_text\n 37.36%   27.544     33 Template:Trim\n 19.44%   14.329      1 Template:PageSeo\n 19.35%   14.266      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 16.20%   11.942      7 Template:Icon_link\n 15.25%   11.241      3 Template:Uid\n  9.32%    6.873      1 Template:SmallIcon\n  8.97%    6.616      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:7904-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715003329 and revision id 402828. Rendering was triggered because: edit-page\n -->\n</div>"}